OL,3,GNEWSASchools forced to close after
OL,4,Awater outage
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome schools in parts of Surrey have
OL,7,Fbeen forced to close after a water
OL,8,Foutage affecting the area.
OL,10,FThames Water said it was investigating
OL,11,Fthe problem affecting Thames Ditton,
OL,12,FEsher, and Sunbury, plus other parts of
OL,13,Fthe county and South West London.
OL,15,FSchools including Long Ditton Infant
OL,16,Fand Nursery School and Thames Ditton
OL,17,FInfant School said on their websites
OL,18,Fthey had been forced to close due to
OL,19,Fissues in the surrounding area which
OL,20,Fwere first reported at about 05:15 BST.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,327,320,200,140,0,100
