OL,3,GNEWSASchools forced to close after
OL,4,Awater outage
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the water company
OL,7,Fapologised to customers, and said its
OL,8,Fengineers were doing everything they
OL,9,Fcould to ensure water was back as soon
OL,10,Fas possible.
